QuestGuidance.Register("es",228,{
[7265]="7007212D\n1\tTalk to Mizâdi\tMizâdi is ready to meet with her allies and plan her strategy for Idagâl. You should speak to Mizâdi to begin the meeting.\n2\tEscucha la conversación\tMizâdi is speaking with her advisors about the situation in Idagâl. You should listen to the conversation.\n",
[7266]="70059AF7\n1\tHabla con Durin\tDurin has the knowledge now to finish the tale of Mótsog.\n2\tListen to Durin conclude the tale\tDurin has agreed to conclude the tale of Mótsog, for it is not that dwarf's tale alone, but Durin's as well.\n3\tHabla con Durin\tDurin has more to say of the Sunder-battle's aftermath.\n4\tListen to Durin conclude the tale\tDurin has agreed to conclude the tale of Mótsog, for it is not that dwarf's tale alone, but Durin's as well.\n5\tHabla con Durin\tDurin wishes to conclude the tale.\n6\tListen to Durin conclude the tale\tDurin has agreed to conclude the tale of Mótsog, for it is not that dwarf's tale alone, but Durin's as well.\n",
[7267]="7004DA6A\n1\tTalk to King Thorin III\tKing Thorin III is standing before his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain. At King Thorin's request, you have come to attend a great feast and celebration in Erebor.\n2\tAttend the Feast of Durin's Folk with King Thorin\tKing Thorin's feasting table can be found on the landing before his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain. You should attend the Feast of Durin's Folk with King Thorin.\n3\tInspect the seat King Thorin has chosen for you\tYour seat can be found next to Dwalin at the leftmost end of the table. King Thorin has offered you a seat at his table, and you should now inspect it as King Thorin asked.\n4\tTalk to King Thorin III\tKing Thorin is standing beside his table in the Hall Under the Mountain. You have inspected the chair King Thorin chose for you, and you should now speak to King Thorin.\n5\tFind Spakorth, Dréri, and Náth and invite them to the Feast of Durin's Folk\tThe Stout-axes can be found somewhere among the celebrations in the Hall Under the Mountain. King Thorin III has asked you to find Spakorth, Dréri, and Náth in Erebor and offer them an invitation to join the King Under the Mountain at his table.\n6\tInvite Spakorth, Dréri, and Náth to the Feast of Durin's Folk\tSpakorth can be found among the revellers in the Hall Under the Mountain. You have found Spakorth, Dréri, and Náth and should now request that they join King Thorin at his table.\n7\tReturn to your seat at the Feast of Durin's Folk\tYou have summoned the Stout-axes to the Feast of Durin's Folk, and you should now return to your seat at King Thorin's table.\n8\tHabla con Glóin\tGlóin can be found at King Thorin's table in the Hall Under the Mountain. You have returned to King Thorin's table, but just as you were about to take your seat, Glóin tried to get your attention. You should speak to him.\n9\tFind Gimli, Dori, and Nori and send them to the Feast of Durin's Folk\tGimli, Dori, and Nori can be found somewhere in the Hall Under the Mountain. Glóin has asked that you find Gimli, Dori, and Nori and send them to join the Feast of Durin's Folk at King Thorin's table.\n10\tHabla con Gimli\tGimli, Dori, and Nori can be found on the upper level of the Hall Under the Mountain. You have found Gimli, Dori, and Nori and should now urge them to attend the Feast of Durin's Folk at King Thorin's table.\n11\tTalk to King Thorin III\tKing Thorin III can be found at his table in the Hall Under the Mountain. You have found all the missing dwarves and should now return to King Thorin III and attend the Feast of Durin's Folk.\n12\tAwait the arrival of King Thorin's final guest\tKing Thorin III was hoping that one more dwarf would attend the Feast of Durin's Folk, but he is uncertain when or if he will arrive. You should wait with King Thorin III.\n13\tListen to King Thorin III\tKing Thorin III is giving a speech to the Dwarves of Durin's Folk in attendance. You should listen to King Thorin III.\n14\tWitness the arrival of King Thorin's final guest\tFrantic shouting has interrupted King Thorin's speech to the Dwarves of Durin's Folk. You should remain alert and witness the arrival of whoever has been shouting.\n15\tListen to King Thorin III and Nár\tKing Thorin III is speaking to the Dwarves of Durin's Folk and welcoming Nár back to Erebor. You should listen to King Thorin III and Nár.\n16\tTalk to King Thorin III\tKing Thorin III is standing beside his table in the Hall Under the Mountain. All of King Thorin's guests have arrived, and now the feast can begin. You should talk to King Thorin.\n",
[7268]="7003A5BE\n1\tEncuentra la pista del Jabalí de Everholt\tEl Jabalí de Everholt está en las cercanías. Las huellas del Jabalí conducen al norte, hacia el sonido del agua corriente.\n2\tSigue la pista del Jabalí de Everholt hacia el norte\tSigue el rastro del Jabalí de Everholt.\n3\tContinúa siguiendo la pista del Jabalí de Everholt hacia el norte\tEl Jabalí de Everholt está muy cerca. Deberías acercarte a la gran criatura con sigilo.\n4\tDerrota al Jabalí de Everholt\tEl Jabalí de Everholt está cerca. Deberías matar a la gran bestia.\n5\tVerifica que el Jabalí de Everholt haya sucumbido a sus heridas\tEl Jabalí de Everholt ha sufrido graves heridas y se dirige hacia el arroyo. Sigue al Jabalí de Everholt para asegurarte de que finalmente has derrotado a la gran bestia.\n6\tNo sucumbas a las heridas sufridas durante la batalla\tEl legendario Jabalí de Everholt ha sido finalmente derrotado. Durante la batalla, sufriste graves heridas y ahora luchas por mantener la conciencia.\n",
[7269]="70071536\n1\tTalk to Jajax on the dock\tYou have come with Jajax, Rothog, and Belondor to destroy the Narghâk weapons used by the Song.\n2\tIf you tamper with the Narghâk weapons aboard the Ordâkhai ship Kosagháti, you should be able to prevent their further use.\t\n3\tStand by Jajax and decide your next course\tYou have successfully disabled the Narghâk weapons aboard the Ordâkhai ship Kosagháti.\n4\tTalk to Jajax on the Kosagháti\tSomething has happened to the Orc-ship Grishúlvosh. Jajax demands your attention.\n5\tTalk to Rothog beside the burning wreck of the Orc-ship Grishúlvosh\tRothog grieves beside his fallen comrade.\n",
[7270]="70015815\n1\tDerrota a los invocadores de orcos de fuego (total: 4)\030Derrota a Oshadhúr\tDebes derrotar a los invocadores de orcos de fuego para evitar que invoquen suficientes espíritus para destruir la biblioteca. Si se reúnen demasiados espíritus dentro de la biblioteca, será consumida en un infierno y se perderá. Una vez que te hayas encargado de los invocadores, deberás enfrentarte al líder de los orcos...\n2\tUsa el yunque antiguo\030Recoge Infused Adamant\tUsa la antigua forja para potenciar tu adamantita infundida.\n",
[7271]="7004E84F\n1\tTalk to Tuhâl\tTuhâl is nervously waiting to speak to the Jangovar leaders. You should talk to Tuhâl.\n2\tEscucha la conversación\tThe Jangovar are conversing. You should listen to the conversation.\n3\tDefeat the Jangovar\tNáin the Slakeless has engaged the Jangovar in battle! You should defeat the Jangovar!\n4\tEscape Utterby with Náin and Tuhâl\tThe dwarves have attacked Utterby! You should follow Náin and escape!\n5\tHabla con Náin\tNáin would like to speak with you. You should talk to Náin.\n",
[7272]="7005843D\n1\tTalk to Bori on the path leading to the threshold of Gundabad\tYou have crossed the lake with Bori, and now he waits to speak with you before you climb to the threshold of Gundabad to meet up with Durin's fighting force.\n2\tPush open the gate to Gorgar's arena\tThe gate to the threshold of Gundabad lies ahead of you, where Gorgar has devised an arena to challenge Prince Durin and his allies. Bori needs your help to push open the gate that lies between you and Durin's fighting force.\n3\tEnter Gorgar's arena and join Durin and his allies\tPrince Durin and his allies stand bravely in the arena of Gorgar the Ruthless on the very threshold of Gundabad.\n4\tRemain on your guard!\tPrince Durin and his allies stand bravely in the arena of Gorgar the Ruthless on the very threshold of Gundabad.\n",
[7273]="7004E755\n1\tTalk to Tuhâl\tThe time has come for Tuhâl of Chayasír to stand before Lord Náin and speak for the Easterling refugees.\n2\tEscucha la conversación\tTuhâl is speaking to Lord Náin. You should listen to the conversation.\n3\tHabla con Náin\tYou have been tasked with infiltrating Utterby! You should talk to Náin.\n",
[7274]="7005A800\n1\tTalk to Dáin\tDáin can be found just outside Muru Azog at Azanulbizar. After overcoming Azog's forces at Durin's Stone, Náin Orcsfoe and the Iron-folk have begun their assault on the gates of Khazad-dûm. You should talk to Dáin.\n2\tFollow Dáin and join in the assault on the gates of Khazad-dûm\tDáin can be found at Muru Azog. You have joined in the assault on the gates of Khazad-dûm. You should follow Dáin and aid the soldiers of the Haban’akkâ.\n3\tWitness as Náin confronts Bolg outside Khazad-dûm\tNáin Orcsfoe and the Iron-folk have broken through Azog's defences at Muru Azog. You should aid Náin and the Iron-folk as they approach the gates of Khazad-dûm.\n4\tHabla con Náin\tNáin can be found outside the gates of Khazad-dûm at Muru Azog. Náin Orcsfoe has driven off the coward Bolg, leaving Azog to face the Haban’akkâ. You should talk to Náin.\n5\tConfront Azog\tAzog can be found outside the East-gate of Khazad-dûm. In answer to Náin's taunts, Azog has come out of the shadows of Khazad-dûm. You should confront Azog with Náin and the Iron-folk.\n6\tWitness Náin as he battles against Azog\tNáin and Azog can be found outside the East-gate of Khazad-dûm. Azog has answered Náin's challenge. You should witness the battle between Náin and Azog.\n7\tDefeat Azog's bodyguards\tAzog's bodyguards can be found outside the East-gate of Khazad-dûm. After slaying Náin, Azog has set his bodyguards upon the Iron-folk. You should defeat Azog's bodyguards.\n8\tDefeat Azog\tAzog can be found outside the East-gate of Khazad-dûm. After slaying Náin, Azog hopes to escape the wrath of the Iron-folk. You should aid Dáin and defeat Azog.\n9\tTalk to Dáin\tDáin can be found outside the East-gate of Khazad-dûm. Dáin has slain Azog. You should talk to Dáin.\n10\tWitness as Dáin enters Khazad-dûm\tDáin can be found at the East-gate of Khazad-dûm. After slaying Azog, Dáin has chosen to enter Khazad-dûm. You should watch as Dáin enters Khazad-dûm.\n11\tWait for Dáin\tDáin has walked into Khazad-dûm. You should await Dáin's return.\n12\tTalk to Dáin\tDáin can be found outside the East-gate of Khazad-dûm. After entering Khazad-dûm, Dáin has returned deeply troubled. You should talk to Dáin.\n",
[7275]="700256E0\n1\tBusca en el templo la ubicación de Ferndúr\tFerndúr el Virulento ha casi completado sus experimentos mortales bajo el templo perdido de Rhudaur. ¡Él y sus sirvientes deben ser derrotados antes de que sus planes se hagan realidad!\n2\tDerrota a Ferndúr el Virulento\tHas descubierto a Ferndúr el Virulento, en la cámara central, en las profundidades del templo perdido de Rhudaur. ¡Él y sus sirvientes deben ser derrotados antes de que sus planes se hagan realidad!\n",
[7276]="70018F14\n1\tBusca entre los papeles esparcidos alguna mención de Zurr-thurkh\tPáginas del taller de Melkólf Tallapiedra están esparcidas por todo el pasaje, y deberías buscarlas en busca de cualquier mención de Zurr-thurkh, el 'camino secreto' que podría conducir a la sala del trono de Durin.\n2\tBusca entre los papeles esparcidos alguna mención de Zurr-thurkh\tPáginas del taller de Melkólf Tallapiedra están esparcidas por todo el pasaje, y deberías buscarlas en busca de cualquier mención de Zurr-thurkh, el 'camino secreto' que podría conducir a la sala del trono de Durin.\n",
[7277]="7006B711\n1\tTalk to Silirtas outside Utug-bûr\tGrieving that the Thardúth had their origins as ancient Kintai, Silirtas greatly desires to do her part in sealing them away.\n2\tPlace Narghâk to the left side of the entrance to Utug-bûr (0/3)\tYou and Sigileth have volunteered to place the Narghâk on the left side of the entrance to Utug-bûr.\n3\tPlace Narghâk to the left side of the entrance to Utug-bûr (1/3)\tYou and Sigileth have volunteered to place the Narghâk on the left side of the entrance to Utug-bûr.\n4\tPlace Narghâk to the left side of the entrance to Utug-bûr (2/3)\tYou and Sigileth have volunteered to place the Narghâk on the left side of the entrance to Utug-bûr.\n5\tCheck on the group placing the Narghâk on the other side\tA sense of exhaustion has overcome you once again, as happened earlier when you journeyed within Maurûsh.\n6\tListen to the threatening voice within your mind\tThe ethereal voice speaks threatening words from within the confines of your mind.\n7\tAwaken Silirtas from the enchantment that keeps her from moving\tSilirtas is in grave danger! She must awaken at once!\n8\tPrevent Azagath from inflicting great harm upon Silirtas\tAt the urging of his Thardúth masters, Azagath intends to do great harm to your friends.\n9\tPrevent Azagath from inflicting great harm upon Silirtas\tAt the urging of his Thardúth masters, Azagath intends to do great harm to your friends.\n10\tPrevent Azagath from inflicting great harm upon Silirtas\tAt the urging of his Thardúth masters, Azagath intends to do great harm to your friends.\n11\tStand your ground\tThe Thardúth turn their attention elsewhere in the battle. The sorcerous exhaustion that troubled you has been lifted.\n",
[7278]="700431A5\n1\tApproach Lady Vanyalos\tLady Vanyalos stands between two trees, off the northward road. You have found Lady Vanyalos. You should approach her and see if she can be persuaded to return to Imloth Melui.\n2\tProtect Lady Vanyalos\tLady Vanyalos is wandering on the greensward by the River Anduin. You should protect the Lady Vanyalos and see if you can get her to come to her senses.\n3\tDefeat Tenakrul\030Protect Lady Vanyalos\tFight the Orc captain among the reeds by the River Anduin. Just as Lady Vanyalos fainted, the Orc captain, Tenakrul, came upon you.\n4\tTalk to Lady Vanyalos\tLady Vanyalos stands among the reeds by the River Anduin. Having come to her senses at last, the Lady Vanyalos looks ready to talk to you.\n",
[7279]="7000D3D6\n1\tHabla con Tasgall\tLa caza de Tasgall los ha llevado a las laderas de Nád Nathair.\n",
[7280]="70029A57\n1\tHabla con Tomos\tTomos se encuentra cerca. Debes hablar con Tomos.\n2\tSigue a Tomos\tTomos está buscando a su esposa, Mari. Debes seguir a Tomos a través de Galtrev.\n3\tSigue a Tomos\tTomos está buscando a su esposa, Mari. Debes seguir a Tomos hasta estar al lado de Mari.\n4\tIntenta apaciguar al supervisor de la Mano Blanca\tUn supervisor de la Mano Blanca ha aparecido, con cara de enfado, para hacer que Tomos pague por su crimen de faltar al trabajo del día. Debes hablar con el supervisor para intentar apaciguarlo.\n5\tAyuda a defender al pueblo de Galtrev\tEl semi-Orco con el que hablaste parece estar iracundo sin motivo. Debes defenderte a ti mismo y a los habitantes del pueblo de la ira de los sirvientes de Isengard.\n6\tAyuda al pueblo de Galtrev\tDerrota a los sirvientes de la Mano Blanca.\n7\tHabla con Mari\tMari está en Galtrev. Debes hablar con Mari.\n",
[7281]="700586FA\n1\tHabla con Derwent Correhuela\tDerwent está encantado de mostrarte su nuevo hogar, el pueblo de Altapiedra.\n2\tReúnete con algunos de los vecinos de Derwent en Altapiedra\tDerwent no entiende por qué crees que Altapiedra tiene fama de ser peligrosa.\n3\tProtege a Derwent y a sus vecinos de los orcos\tHa ocurrido algo que no sucedía desde hace ocho días: ¡Los orcos han llegado al pueblo de Altapiedra!\n4\tHabla con Derwent Correhuela en Altapiedra\tDerwent Correhuela está asustado, pero por lo demás ileso.\n5\tHabla con Derwent Correhuela en Altapiedra\tDerwent Correhuela ha hecho un descubrimiento desagradable, aunque no especialmente sorprendente.\n",
[7282]="700147F1\n1\tHabla con Galadriel\tGaladriel te espera en el centro del jardín. Galadriel te ha hecho llamar a su jardín de Lothlórien, porque desea hablar contigo.\n2\tMira en el Espejo de Galadriel\tEl Espejo de Galadriel se encuentra en el centro del jardín. Galadriel te ha invitado a mirar en su Espejo y a preguntarle lo que quieres ver.\n3\tHabla con Galadriel\tGaladriel te espera en el centro del jardín. Has visto cosas extrañas en el Espejo de Galadriel, incluyendo imágenes confusas de Gandalf y una terrible criatura: un Balrog, el Daño de Durin.\n4\tEscucha las palabras de Galadriel sobre tu destino\tGaladriel te espera en el centro del jardín. La Dama Galadriel ha visto más que el destino de Mithrandir en su Espejo; también ha visto algunos indicios de tu propio destino.\n5\tHabla con Gwaihir\tGwaihir, el Señor de los Vientos, ha venido a descansar en el jardín de Galadriel. Galadriel te ha pedido que vayas a hablar con Gwaihir sobre el destino de Gandalf el Gris.\n",
[7283]="70037DB9\n1\tHabla con Horn en Burg-shápol\tHorn está dentro de Burg-shápol, la cueva en el Everholt donde podrían encontrarse los artesanos desaparecidos.\n2\tHabla con Horn en Burg-shápol\tHorn está en los túneles de Burg-shápol.\n3\tHorn se ha quedado atrás para retrasar el avance de los orcos que le siguen, mientras tú buscas a los artesanos desaparecidos en los túneles de Burg-shápol.\t\n4\tHabla con Nona en Burg-shápol\tHas encontrado a Nona y Corudan en las profundidades de Burg-shápol.\n5\tHabla con Corudan en Burg-shápol\tCorudan está en las profundidades de Burg-shápol.\n6\tSobrevive al regreso de los orcos a Burg-shápol\t¡Muchos orcos han regresado a Burg-shápol, y debes derrotarlos!\n",
[7284]="70015709\n1\tRecoge fragmentos de mineral de mithril (total: 14)\030Derrota al capataz de la mina\tDebes encontrar suficientes fragmentos de mineral de mithril para poder aprovechar la forja de fundición y obtener la calidad que buscas. Con suerte, los trasgos esclavizados habrán logrado recolectar suficiente mineral para satisfacer tus necesidades... ahora es poco probable que se desprendan de él por las buenas.\n2\tUsa el yunque antiguo\030Recoge Infused Garnet\030Recoge Mithril Ore Fragment (total: 14)\tUtiliza la antigua forja y los fragmentos de mineral de mithril que has recogido para potenciar tu granate imbuido.\n",
[7285]="7006B58C\n1\tTalk to Rahâzi\tPart of the way back to Iridír, Rahâzi has called for a halt. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n2\tTalk to Rahâzi\tRahâzi and Surdûsha have triumphed over the Ordâkhai, but now a new threat emerges. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n3\tStand your ground against Tatháta and protect the Dumûri warriors\tStand your ground against Tatháta and protect the Dumûri warriors.\n4\tTalk to Rothog the Storm\tRothog the Storm has arrived, and his arrival may have saved you and the Dumûri warriors from Tatháta's wrath.\n5\tTalk to Khôltekh\tKhôltekh has arrived in Ambarûl.\n6\tObserve the meeting of Khôltekh and Rahâzi\tRothog and Khôltekh have arrived in Ambarûl, and they seek to gain permission from its people to carry out the mission they share with you.\n7\tTalk to Rahâzi\tRahâzi waits to speak with you before she departs.\n8\tTalk to Khôltekh\tKhôltekh has some words for you before you continue on to Iridír.\n",
[7286]="700157C3\n1\tRecoger herramientas robadas (total: 4)\030Derrota a la señora de los morroval\tDebes derrotar a los ladrones de morroval y recuperar las herramientas que han tomado de la forja. También debes evitar que los carroñeros que huyen escapen de la forja, para que no se lleven demasiadas piezas importantes de equipo.\n2\tUsa el yunque antiguo\030Recoge Infused Sapphire\tUsa la antigua forja para potenciar tu zafiro infundido.\n",
[7287]="70038A26\n1\tSpeak with Grimbold\tGrimbold sits at Théodred's grave at the Fords of Isen. You should speak with Grimbold.\n2\tEscucha a Grimbold\tGrimbold sits at Théodred's grave at the Fords of Isen. You should speak with Grimbold.\n3\tTell Grimbold the story of Elfhelm's regret\tGrimbold sits at Théodred's grave at the Fords of Isen. You should talk to Grimbold -- tell him the story of Elfhelm's regret. You must select your target and perform the emote.\n4\tTell Grimbold the story of Elfhelm's regret\tGrimbold sits at Théodred's grave at the Fords of Isen. You should talk to Grimbold -- tell him the story of Elfhelm's regret. You must select your target and perform the emote.\n5\tTell Grimbold the story of Hildith's regret\tGrimbold sits at Théodred's grave at the Fords of Isen. You should talk to Grimbold -- tell him the story of Hildith's regret. You must select your target and perform the emote.\n6\tTell Grimbold the story of Hildith's regret\tGrimbold sits at Théodred's grave at the Fords of Isen. You should talk to Grimbold -- tell him the story of Hildith's regret. You must select your target and perform the emote.\n7\tTell Grimbold the story of the king\tGrimbold sits at Théodred's grave at the Fords of Isen. You should talk to Grimbold -- tell him the story of the king's recovery. You must select your target and perform the emote.\n8\tTell Grimbold the story of the king\tGrimbold sits at Théodred's grave at the Fords of Isen. You should talk to Grimbold -- tell him the story of the king's recovery. You must select your target and perform the emote.\n9\tSpeak with Grimbold\tGrimbold is at Théodred's grave at the Fords of Isen. You should speak with Grimbold.\n10\tSpeak with Grimbold\tGrimbold is at the Fords of Isen. You should speak with Grimbold.\n11\tTry to defeat Bosnauk with Grimbold\tThe troll Bosnauk is at the Fords of Isen. You should defeat Bosnauk with Grimbold, if you can.\n12\tObserve the meeting at the fords\tGandalf is at the Fords of Isen. You should speak with Gandalf.\n13\tHabla con Gandalf\tGandalf is at the Fords of Isen. You should speak with Gandalf.\n",
[7288]="7004D3D8\n1\tPatrol Loeglond.\t\n2\tCheck on the trap\tCheck on the trap.\n3\tTalk to Sírithon\tTalk to Sírithon.\n4\tInvestigate the noises\tInvestigate the noises.\n5\tReturn to the trap\tReturn to the trap.\n6\tTalk to Sírithon\tTalk to Sírithon.\n",
[7289]="70059ACE\n1\tHabla con Durin\tDurin stands in the chamber of Zul-mazal, ready to learn whatever secrets may remain between its walls.\n2\tRemain vigilant while the dwarves consider the chamber\tDurin and the dwarves examine the chamber for clues.\n3\tTalk to Stáli the Hewer\tStáli the Hewer believes his time has come at last.\n4\tObserve the restoration of the mosaic\tThe dwarves believe they have uncovered the key to the mystery of Zul-mazal.\n5\tHabla con Durin\tBósi and Durin have heard the sounds of approaching enemies.\n6\tWitness the completion of the mosaic\tStáli and Fastrith have finished assembling the mosaic.\n7\tTalk to Fastrith\tFastrith has had an idea.\n8\tWitness the completion of the mosaic... again\tFastrith is eager to carry out her idea.\n9\tHabla con Bósi.\tBósi, former leader of the Iron Garrison, has warned you that more hobgoblins approach.\n10\tObserve the completed mosaic\tStáli and Fastrith have once again finished assembling the mosaic.\n11\tHabla con Durin\tYou and the dwarves have uncovered the secret of Zul-mazal, and now Durin must decide what should be done.\n",
[7290]="7001AEC6\n1\tHabla con Ianudirel\tHabla con Ianudirel y lucha para cruzar el puente hacia Krul Lugu.\n2\tHabla con Ianudirel para regresar con Iavassúl.\t\n",
[7291]="7006B54F\n1\tTalk to Sirgon inside the Citadel of Winds\tYou and Sirgon have been escorted to an upper level of the Citadel of Winds.\n2\tTalk to Hármelak inside the tower room\tHármelak and other leaders of the Kindred of the Coins await you in a tower room inside the Citadel of Winds.\n3\tAttend your meeting with the Kindred of the Coins\tWithin a tower room inside the Citadel of Winds, the Kindred of the Coins discuss the days to come.\n4\tTalk to Hármelak inside the tower room\tHármelak and other leaders of the Kindred of the Coins await you in a tower room inside the Citadel of Winds.\n5\tListen to the Kindred discuss the disappearance of Balakhâd\tThe Kindred of the Coins discuss the recent past with you and Sirgon in a tower room in the Citadel of Winds.\n6\tTalk to Belondor inside the tower room\tBelondor wishes to tell you what the Kindred knows concerning Balakhâd's escape from the Citadel of Winds.\n7\tListen to the Kindred discuss the disappearance of Balakhâd\tThe Kindred of the Coins discuss the disappearance of Balakhâd with you and Sirgon in a tower room in the Citadel of Winds.\n8\tTalk to Hármelak inside the tower room\tHármelak wishes to discuss with you the road ahead.\n9\tListen to the Kindred discuss the adventure to come\tThe Kindred of the Coins discuss the mission to pursue Azagath and Nakási.\n10\tTalk to Sirgon in the tower room\tSirgon has volunteered for the dangerous mission to pursue Azagath and Nakási into the wild lands of the east and south.\n11\tListen to the Kindred discuss the adventure to come\tThe Kindred of the Coins discuss the mission to pursue Azagath and Nakási.\n12\tTalk to Hármelak in the tower room\tHármelak wishes to address you before you depart.\n",
[7292]="700215AA\n1\tAcompaña a Saeradan para enfrentarte a Gwyllion\tHabla con Saeradan en la Puerta de Gwyllion.\n2\tDerrota a Gwyllion y a sus lugartenientes\tBusca a Gwyllion en su choza más allá de la Puerta de Gwyllion.\n3\tHabla con Saeradan\tHabla con Saeradan para regresar a Echad Saeradan.\n",
[7293]="7002C91B\n1\tHabla con Rothulf\tWynmar, Rothulf y los demás cazadores Rohirrim se preparan ahora para hacer frente a un ataque.\n2\tAyuda a Rothulf a sacar a Wynmar de su aflicción\tRothulf y Wynmar se encuentran en su campamento en Thinglad\n3\tVe si Wynmar está listo para luchar\tRothulf y Wynmar se encuentran en su campamento en Thinglad\n4\tDerrota a los orcos atacantes\t¡Los orcos atacan! Debes derrotarlos.\n5\tHabla con Rothulf\tRothulf se encuentra en el campamento.\n6\tHabla con Wynmar\tWynmar se encuentra en su campamento.\n7\tVe si Wynmar y Noriel necesitan tu ayuda\tNoriel y Wynmar hablan en voz baja entre ellos.\n8\tPregúntale a Noriel si Wynmar sobrevivirá\tNoriel cura las heridas de Wynmar.\n",
[7294]="70071BC6\n1\tWhat is going on?\tIs there a fight in the tavern? You should get closer to see what is going on.\n2\tDerrota a los rufianes\tYou found two ruffians beating Sâdikiz as he lay on the floor. You should stop them and defeat the ruffians.\n3\tTalk to Sâdikiz\tYou have defeated the ruffians who were beating Sâdikiz as he lay helpless on the floor. You should talk to the relieved dwarf.\n",
